# The working tree is the same bytes on every platform, because the artifact is packed from it.
#
# `npm pack` takes the files as they sit on disk, and without this git checks them out with CRLF on
# Windows and LF elsewhere — so the published digest depended on which machine packed it. That is
# the property the Skill archive was fixed for; the archive reads its bytes from the object database
# and was never exposed, while the package was, and the Windows lane never reached the check that
# would have said so.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and never to be converted or diffed.
vendor/**/*.wasm -diff -text
vendor/runtime/tree-sitter.cjs -diff -text
